WEBVTT

00:03:28.996 --> 00:03:30.996
"Are you carrying clean needles?"

00:03:30.996 --> 00:03:33.996
One in four, maximum.

00:03:33.996 --> 00:03:35.996
So no surprises then that

00:03:35.996 --> 00:03:37.996
the proportion that actually used clean needles

00:03:37.996 --> 00:03:39.996
every time they injected in the last week

00:03:39.996 --> 00:03:42.996
is just about one in 10,

00:03:42.996 --> 00:03:45.996
and the other nine in 10 are sharing.

00:03:45.996 --> 00:03:47.996
So you've got this massive mismatch;

00:03:47.996 --> 00:03:49.996
everyone knows that

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.996
if they share they're going to get HIV,

00:03:51.996 --> 00:03:53.996
but they're all sharing anyway.

00:03:53.996 --> 00:03:56.996
So what's that about? Is it like you get a better high if you share or something?

00:03:56.996 --> 00:03:59.996
We asked that to a junkie and they're like, "Are you nuts?"

00:03:59.996 --> 00:04:01.996
You don't want to share a needle anymore than you want